ss=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\r\n    \/* SCOPED SAFE CSS *\/\r\n    .ct-visa-wrapper {\r\n        font-family: 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\r\n        color: #333;\r\n        line-height: 1.6;\r\n        max-width: 100%;\r\n        margin: 0 auto;\r\n        padding: 40px 0;\r\n        box-sizing: border-box;\r\n        font-weight: 400;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .ct-visa-wrapper *, .ct-visa-wrapper *::before, .ct-visa-wrapper *::after {\r\n        box-sizing: border-box;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/* --- MAIN HEADING STYLE --- *\/\r\n    .ct-visa-wrapper h2 {\r\n        color: #0b2c6b;\r\n        font-size: 30px;\r\n        margin-top: 0;\r\n        margin-bottom: 30px;\r\n        padding-bottom: 10px;\r\n        font-weight: 700;\r\n        border-bottom: 1px solid #dae1e7;\r\n        position: relative;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .ct-visa-wrapper h2::after {\r\n        content: '';\r\n        position: absolute;\r\n        left: 0;\r\n        bottom: -1px;\r\n        width: 50px;\r\n        height: 3px;\r\n        \r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/* --- SUB-HEADINGS --- *\/\r\n    .ct-visa-wrapper h3 {\r\n        font-size: 17px;\r\n        color: #222;\r\n        font-weight: 700;\r\n        margin-top: 25px;\r\n        margin-bottom: 10px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/* --- PARAGRAPH TEXT --- *\/\r\n    .ct-visa-wrapper p {\r\n        margin-bottom: 15px;\r\n        font-size: 16px;\r\n        color: #444;\r\n        text-align: justify;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/* --- BULLET LISTS --- *\/\r\n    .ct-visa-wrapper ul {\r\n        list-style-type: disc;\r\n        padding-left: 20px;\r\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\r\n        margin-top: 5px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .ct-visa-wrapper li {\r\n        font-size: 16px;\r\n        color: #444;\r\n        margin-bottom: 8px;\r\n        line-height: 1.5;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/* --- AGENCY FEE LIST --- *\/\r\n    .ct-fee-list {\r\n        list-style-type: none !important;\r\n        padding-left: 0 !important;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .ct-fee-list li {\r\n        border-bottom: 1px dashed #eee;\r\n        padding: 5px 0;\r\n        width: fit-content;\r\n        min-width: 200px;\r\n        display: flex;\r\n        justify-content: space-between;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .ct-fee-list li strong {\r\n        color: #0b2c6b;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/* --- LINK STYLE --- *\/\r\n    .ct-visa-link {\r\n        color: #0b2c6b;\r\n        font-weight: 700;\r\n        text-decoration: underline;\r\n    }\r\n    .ct-visa-link:hover {\r\n        text-decoration: none;\r\n        color: #0056b3;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n<\/style>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ct-visa-wrapper\">\r\n    \r\n    <h2>Cambodia Student Visa Procedure<\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <h3>Visa Category: E-class (ES) Student Visa<\/h3>\r\n    <p>\r\n        Foreign students enrolled in Cambodian educational institutions must obtain an E-class (ordinary) Student Visa, often referred to as ES. This visa permits legal study and residence in Cambodia, with options for multiple extensions while the course is ongoing.\r\n    <\/p>\r\n\r\n    <h3>Duration & Extensions<\/h3>\r\n    <ul>\r\n        <li><strong>Initial validity:<\/strong> 30 days (Apply for tourist E-visa)<\/li>\r\n        <li><strong>Extension options:<\/strong> Inside Cambodia, you can extend it in increments of 1, 3, 6, or 12 months, depending on your study duration.<\/li>\r\n    <\/ul>\r\n\r\n    <h3>Application Requirements for Initial Visa<\/h3>\r\n    <p>Applicants should prepare and submit the following:<\/p>\r\n    <ul>\r\n        <li>Valid passport (min. 6 months validity).<\/li>\r\n        <li>Passport-sized photos. (White Background)<\/li>\r\n        <li>Letter of acceptance from CamTech or equivalent institution.<\/li>\r\n        <li>Proof of financial capability to support living and tuition.<\/li>\r\n        <li>Medical insurance documentation.<\/li>\r\n    <\/ul>\r\n\r\n    <h3>How to Apply<\/h3>\r\n    <ul>\r\n        <li>Visit the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.evisa.gov.kh\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ct-visa-link\" rel=\"noopener\">official eVisa website<\/a> for Cambodia.<\/li>\r\n        <li>Click on \"<a href=\"https:\/\/www.evisa.gov.kh\/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ct-visa-link\" rel=\"noopener\">Apply for eVisa<\/a>\" and select \"Tourism (ordinary)\" as the purpose of your visit.<\/li>\r\n        <li>Fill out the application form with your personal information and upload the required documents, including your passport and a passport-style photo.<\/li>\r\n        <li>Pay the visa fee online using a credit card or PayPal.<\/li>\r\n        <li>Submit your application and wait for the approval notification via email.<\/li>\r\n        <li>Print out your eVisa and bring it with you to Cambodia along with your passport and other supporting documents.<\/li>\r\n    <\/ul>\r\n\r\n    <h3>Cost & Processing<\/h3>\r\n    <ul>\r\n        <li><strong>Online visa (e-Visa):<\/strong> USD $35, valid for 30 days, single-entry, processed in ~3 business days.<\/li>\r\n        <li><strong>In-country visa extensions (ES):<\/strong> additional fees apply\u2014amounts may vary, but typical extension processing is through immigration services.<\/li>\r\n    <\/ul>\r\n\r\n    <h3>Extension<\/h3>\r\n    <p>\r\n        A 6-month visa extension fee in Cambodia generally costs around $160 to $170 USD when obtained through an agent for an \"Extension Of Stay\" (EOS), or it can be around $180 if applying directly to the Ministry, though fees are subject to change and may vary depending on your nationality and the specific E-type visa you hold.\r\n    <\/p>\r\n\r\n    <h3>Agency Fee for Visa extension<\/h3>\r\n    <ul class=\"ct-fee-list\">\r\n        <li>1 year : <strong>295$<\/strong><\/li>\r\n        <li>6 months : <strong>175$<\/strong><\/li>\r\n        <li>3 months: <strong>85$<\/strong><\/li>\r\n    <\/ul>\r\n\r\n<\/div>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c26810d elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"c26