AGRAPH TEXT --- *\/\r\n    .ct-application-wrapper p {\r\n        margin-bottom: 15px;\r\n        font-size: 16px;\r\n        color: #444;\r\n        text-align: justify;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/* --- BULLET LISTS --- *\/\r\n    .ct-application-wrapper ul {\r\n        list-style-type: disc;\r\n        padding-left: 20px;\r\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\r\n        margin-top: 5px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .ct-application-wrapper li {\r\n        font-size: 16px;\r\n        color: #444;\r\n        margin-bottom: 8px;\r\n        line-height: 1.5;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/* --- ITALIC TERM LABELS --- *\/\r\n    .ct-term-text {\r\n        font-style: italic;\r\n        font-weight: 600;\r\n        color: #555;\r\n        margin-bottom: 5px !important; \/* Reduces gap before the list *\/\r\n        margin-top: 15px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n<\/style>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ct-application-wrapper\">\r\n    \r\n    <h2>Application Process:<\/h2>\r\n    \r\n    <h3>Admission Requirements<\/h3>\r\n    <ul>\r\n        <li>Scanned copy of valid passport (and visa if available)<\/li>\r\n        <li>A letter of recommendation from the host institution or lecturer<\/li>\r\n        <li>An official transcript from the host institution<\/li>\r\n        <li>A valid certificate of English language proficiency (IELTS = 5.5 or equivalent)<\/li>\r\n        <li>Current photo of 4 x 6 with a white background<\/li>\r\n        <li>A health certificate issued within the last 6 months<\/li>\r\n        <li>Passing the CamTech panel interview<\/li>\r\n    <\/ul>\r\n\r\n    <h3>Application Process<\/h3>\r\n    <ul>\r\n        <li>Apply online through this link: <a href=\"https:\/\/forms.gle\/XoCfPEbMtrxymaij9\" style=\"color:#0b2c6b; font-weight:bold;\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https:\/\/forms.gle\/XoCfPEbMtrxymaij9<\/a><\/li>\r\n        <li>Submit required documents, including academic transcripts and proof of English language proficiency<\/li>\r\n        <li>Receive an offer letter on your application within 3 weeks.<\/li>\r\n    <\/ul>\r\n\r\n    <h3>Application Period<\/h3>\r\n    \r\n    <p class=\"ct-term-text\">First term:<\/p>\r\n    <ul>\r\n        <li>Receiving an application in Mid-November to late December<\/li>\r\n        <li>Starting academic term in early January<\/li>\r\n    <\/ul>\r\n\r\n    <p class=\"ct-term-text\">Second term:<\/p>\r\n    <ul>\r\n        <li>Receiving an application in Mid-March to late April<\/li>\r\n        <li>Starting academic term in early January<\/li>\r\n    <\/ul>\r\n\r\n    <p class=\"ct-term-text\">Third term:<\/p>\r\n    <ul>\r\n        <li>Receiving an application in Mid-July to late August<\/li>\r\n        <li>Starting academic term in early October.<\/li>\r\n    <\/ul>\r\n\r\n    <p style=\"margin-top: 30px; font-weight: 500;\">\r\n        Don't miss this opportunity to experience the world-class education in Cambodia, surrounded by its rich history, stunning natural beauty, and warm hospitality. Apply now to join our international student exchange program at CamTech University.\r\n    <\/p>\r\n\r\n<\/div>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8c53bdc e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"8c53bdc\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Cambodia Student Visa Procedure Visa Category: E-class (ES) Student Visa Foreign students enrolled in Cambodian educational institutions must obtain an E-class (ordinary) Student Visa, often referred to as ES. This visa permits legal study and residence in Cambodia, with options for multiple extensions while the course is ongoing. Duration &#038; Extensions Initial validity: 30 days (Apply for tourist E-visa) Extension options: Inside Cambodia, you can extend it in increments of 1, 3, 6, or 12 months, depending on your study duration. Application Requirements for Initial Visa Applicants shoul